    "description": "Import: Postman → Import → select this file.\n\nFolders = API routers.\n\nFlow:\n1. Auth → Login (saves {{token}})\n2. Departments → Create / List (saves {{departmentId}})\n3. Countries → Create / List (saves {{countryId}})\n4. Employees → Create\n5. Employees → Set salary (joining), then hike\n6. Salary → Calculate\n7. Analytics → by-country / by-job-title",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
